@baseUrl = http://localhost:5173

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Create a user
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zack",
  "displayName": "Zack"
}

### Create a second user
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ana",
  "displayName": "Ana"
}

### Get user 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1

### Duplicate username (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "zack", "displayName": "Copy" }

### Make 1 and 2 friends (expect 204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/1/friends/2

### List user 1's friends
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1/friends